    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Data Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Raw CSV is outside the repo under shared_dataset and currently reports 549084 OHLCV rows",
        "Cleaning keeps 396 trainable symbols after valid OHLCV checks and the 250-session filter",
        "Feature engineering writes 15 technical signals and 509211 labeled ML rows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Model Selection",
      "items": [
        "Tuning Lab stores selected params for Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and Gradient Boosting",
        "Official pipeline recomputes TimeSeriesSplit CV on TRAIN, then evaluates TEST once per fingerprint",
        "Imbalance handled per model (LR/RF class_weight, GB sample_weight); F1-optimal threshold tuned on TRAIN folds",
        "select_final_model ranks f1_up, then recall_up, then simplicity; final is Random Forest (test F1_UP 0.4816, Recall_UP 0.9053)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Serving + Guards",
      "items": [
        "Flask and CLI load final_model.pkl and model_metadata.json without retraining",
        "Prediction recomputes the latest feature row from clean symbol history",
        "SQLite prediction logging is best-effort and never blocks rendering the result"
      ]
    }
